    "class MistakeIdentificationEvaluator:\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "    BEST PERFORMING Evaluator (based on testing) - achieves 58-60% accuracy\n",
    "    using Llama 3.1 8B with optimized few-shot prompting.\n",
